Seven platforms enter the work registry with localized summaries in all
four locales: ForgeOS (the robotic OS behind the Forge Line), FloorForge,
PaintForge and DryForge AI (public repos, linked), GridForge AI,
ForgePower Semi and ThermalForge (in development). Cards, mega menu and
command palette pick them up automatically; public Forge repos link to
source per the registry's provenance rule.
